### Plants — CREATE (expects 201 Created)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Planta de Aprovechamiento Albania",
  "municipality": "Albania",
  "address": "Vía a Cuestecitas km 2, Albania",
  "description": "Clasificación de plásticos y metales de la zona minera",
  "status": "active"
}

### Plants — CREATE without municipality (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Planta sin municipio"
}

### Plants — CREATE duplicate name (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Planta de Aprovechamiento Albania",
  "municipality": "Albania"
}
